        "TileImage": "$($repository cb7b9923-0098-4336-8bff-6ca0d5d46440).Image",
        "Description": "Good to see your body handling well with the antidote we gave you back at hokaido! we haven&apos;t told us our names when we are escaping, I&apos;m Dogday and this is Catnap. Anyways you might be confuse how you ended like that in the first place.. apparently you where targetted by the pal genetic research syndicate and they are planning to research you through dissection but we put a stop to that! we are not safe tho.. 4 members are in the vicinity looking for you! do it quietly or they may be alearted..",
